 "remarks": "Welcome home to this spacious 2 bedroom, 1 bath end unit on the 4th floor, perfectly located near everything you need. Enjoy a lifestyle of comfort and convenience with heat and hot water included in your HOA. Kitchen and bathroom renovations have been done, nothing to do here! Please note, the two year elevator upgrades in this building have been completed. The community offers fantastic amenities including a pool and pool house, a fitness center, on-site laundry, and a common room available for private gatherings or celebrations. One assigned parking space adds to the ease of living here, additional spaces are available as well. Pets welcomed. This desirable end unit provides extra privacy with only one direct neighbor, not two like other units. It has an abundance of natural light, and an easy commute to shopping, dining, parks, and major highways. Come see why this home and location are such a great find!",
